OL,3,GNEWSAHabitat destroyed by Cairngorms
OL,4,Afire to be restored with government
OL,5,Afunding
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than #1m is to be spent on nature
OL,8,Frecovery projects, including the
OL,9,Frestoration of habitats destroyed by a
OL,10,Ffire which ripped through a huge area
OL,11,Fof hillside in the Cairngorms.
OL,13,FThe Scottish government funding will
OL,14,Fsupport habitat, species and river
OL,15,Frestoration, control of invasive
OL,16,Fnon-native species and deer management
OL,17,Facross Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
