OL,3,GNEWSAHabitat destroyed by Cairngorms
OL,4,Afire to be restored with government
OL,5,Afunding
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt includes #150,100 for recovery and
OL,8,Fnature restoration work following the
OL,9,FAbernethy wildfire in the Cairngorms in
OL,10,FJuly, to restore damaged habitats, help
OL,11,Fwildlife recover and reduce the risk of
OL,12,Ffuture wildfires.
OL,14,FFurther funding will be provided to a
OL,15,Frange of other projects.
